  "releaseNotes": "'## [9.11.5-prerelease.1](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/compare/v9.11.4...v9.11.5-prerelease.1) (2025-10-01)\n\n### Bug Fixes\n\n* Dockerfile do chown operation as part of COPY ([#952](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/952)) ([03707f3](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/commit/03707f3a4f649324dad7c2c00400de23b9e78a62))\n\n### Dependencies\n\n* **docs:** update docusaurus monorepo to v3.9.0 ([#953](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/953)) ([d2943aa](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/commit/d2943aaa9c2b4efc6619973efc5416c420657ce1))\n* **docs:** update docusaurus monorepo to v3.9.1 ([#956](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/956)) ([a00fdc3](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/commit/a00fdc389a045ed2afc14e10a7f5529ae4424fc5))\n* **test:** update dependency fluentassertions to 8.7.0 ([#954](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/954)) ([9fc3cc2](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/commit/9fc3cc251c2447c27ab3bae9e3c7e4f8b7920327))\n* **test:** update dependency xunit.runner.visualstudio to 3.1.5 ([#957](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/957)) ([1e427a1](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/commit/1e427a1b7bf54866d21eae4b107a32547b786f41))\n* **tools:** update dependency nuget-license to v4 ([#951](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/951)) ([716ad35](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/commit/716ad355adb86b8a4f15f254535f43f43e30caa1))\n'",
